{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785677192539,"sessionID":"ses_03d6082b8ffevm2f5lmWdFLskw","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"bash_21","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport csv, re, unicodedata\ndef norm(s):\n    s = re.sub(r'\\s*\\([^)]*\\)', '', s).strip()\n    s = ''.join(c for c in unicodedata.normalize('NFD', s) if unicodedata.category(c) != 'Mn')\n    return s.lower()\nrows = list(csv.DictReader(open('/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-syu3u3ut/retort-02000dd611c2/data/kaggle/Brasileirao_Matches.csv', encoding='utf-8')))\nna = sum(1 for r in rows if r['home_goal'] in ('NA','') or r['away_goal'] in ('NA',''))\nprint('NA-goal rows:', na, 'of', len(rows))\nplayed = [r for r in rows if r['home_goal'] not in ('NA','') and r['away_goal'] not in ('NA','')]\nh = [r for r in played if r['season']=='2022' and norm(r['home_team']).startswith('corinthians')]\nw = sum(1 for r in h if int(r['home_goal'])>int(r['away_goal']))\nd = sum(1 for r in h if r['home_goal']==r['away_goal'])\nl = len(h)-w-d\ngf = sum(int(r['home_goal']) for r in h); ga = sum(int(r['away_goal']) for r in h)\nprint('Corinthians home 2022:', len(h), 'W', w, 'D', d, 'L', l, 'GF', gf, 'GA', ga)\nff = [r for r in played if {norm(r['home_team']), norm(r['away_team'])} == {'flamengo-rj','fluminense-rj'}]\nprint('Fla-Flu played:', len(ff))\nfrom collections import defaultdict\npts = defaultdict(lambda: [0,0,0,0,0,0])  # pts, w, d, l, gf, ga\nfor r in played:\n    if r['season']!='2019': continue\n    ht, at = r['home_team'], r['away_team']; hg, ag = int(r['home_goal']), int(r['away_goal'])\n    if hg>ag: pts[ht][0]+=3; pts[ht][1]+=1; pts[at][3]+=1\n    elif hg<ag: pts[at][0]+=3; pts[at][1]+=1; pts[ht][3]+=1\n    else: pts[ht][0]+=1; pts[at][0]+=1; pts[ht][2]+=1; pts[at][2]+=1\n    pts[ht][4]+=hg; pts[ht][5]+=ag; pts[at][4]+=ag; pts[at][5]+=hg\ntable = sorted(pts.items(), key=lambda kv:(-kv[1][0],-kv[1][1],-(kv[1][4]-kv[1][5])))\nfor t,v in table[:3]: print('2019:', t, v)\nfor t,v in table[-4:]: print('2019 bottom:', t, v)\nprint('teams:', len(table))\n\""},"output":"NA-goal rows: 82 of 4180\nCorinthians home 2022: 15 W 10 D 4 L 1 GF 21 GA 7\nFla-Flu played: 22\n2019: Flamengo-RJ [90, 28, 6, 4, 86, 37]\n2019: Santos-SP [74, 22, 8, 8, 60, 33]\n2019: Palmeiras-SP [74, 21, 11, 6, 61, 32]\n2019 bottom: Cruzeiro-MG [36, 7, 15, 16, 27, 46]\n2019 bottom: Csa-AL [32, 8, 8, 22, 24, 58]\n2019 bottom: Chapecoense-SC [32, 7, 11, 20, 31, 52]\n2019 bottom: Avai-SC [20, 3, 11, 24, 18, 62]\nteams: 20\n","metadata":{"output":"NA-goal rows: 82 of 4180\nCorinthians home 2022: 15 W 10 D 4 L 1 GF 21 GA 7\nFla-Flu played: 22\n2019: Flamengo-RJ [90, 28, 6, 4, 86, 37]\n2019: Santos-SP [74, 22, 8, 8, 60, 33]\n2019: Palmeiras-SP [74, 21, 11, 6, 61, 32]\n2019 bottom: Cruzeiro-MG [36, 7, 15, 16, 27, 46]\n2019 bottom: Csa-AL [32, 8, 8, 22, 24, 58]\n2019 bottom: Chapecoense-SC [32, 7, 11, 20, 31, 52]\n2019 bottom: Avai-SC [20, 3, 11, 24, 18, 62]\nteams: 20\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 -c \"\nimport csv, re, unicodedata\ndef norm(s):\n    s = re.sub(r'\\s*\\([^)]*\\)', '', s).strip()\n    s = ''.join(c for c in unicodedata.normalize('NFD', s) if unicodedata.category(c) != 'Mn')\n    return s.lower()\nrows = list(csv.DictReader(open('/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-syu3u3ut/retort-02000dd611c2/data/kaggle/Brasileirao_Matches.csv', encoding='utf-8')))\nna = sum(1 for r in rows if r['home_goal'] in ('NA','') or r['away_goal'] in ('NA',''))\nprint('NA-goal rows:', na, 'of', len(rows))\nplayed = [r for r in rows if r['home_goal'] not in ('NA','') and r['away_goal'] not in ('NA','')]\nh = [r for r in played if r['season']=='2022' and norm(r['home_team']).startswith('corinthians')]\nw = sum(1 for r in h if int(r['home_goal'])>int(r['away_goal']))\nd = sum(1 for r in h if r['home_goal']==r['away_goal'])\nl = len(h)-w-d\ngf = sum(int(r['home_goal']) for r in h); ga = sum(int(r['away_goal']) for r in h)\nprint('Corinthians home 2022:', len(h), 'W', w, 'D', d, 'L', l, 'GF', gf, 'GA', ga)\nff = [r for r in played if {norm(r['home_team']), norm(r['away_team'])} == {'flamengo-rj','fluminense-rj'}]\nprint('Fla-Flu played:', len(ff))\nfrom collections import defaultdict\npts = defaultdict(lambda: [0,0,0,0,0,0])  # pts, w, d, l, gf, ga\nfor r in played:\n    if r['season']!='2019': continue\n    ht, at = r['home_team'], r['away_team']; hg, ag = int(r['home_goal']), int(r['away_goal'])\n    if hg>ag: pts[ht][0]+=3; pts[ht][1]+=1; pts[at][3]+=1\n    elif hg<ag: pts[at][0]+=3; pts[at][1]+=1; pts[ht][3]+=1\n    else: pts[ht][0]+=1; pts[at][0]+=1; pts[ht][2]+=1; pts[at][2]+=1\n    pts[ht][4]+=hg; pts[ht][5]+=ag; pts[at][4]+=ag; pts[at][5]+=hg\ntable = sorted(pts.items(), key=lambda kv:(-kv[1][0],-kv[1][1],-(kv[1][4]-kv[1][5])))\nfor t,v in table[:3]: print('2019:', t, v)\nfor t,v in table[-4:]: print('2019 bottom:', t, v)\nprint('teams:', len(table))\n\"","time":{"start":1785677192533,"end":1785677192537}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Important: Brasileirao_Matches.csv has 'NA' goal values (unplayed/postponed matches)! Must handle 'NA' goals — treat match as not played (skip from stats) or nullable goals. Also BR-Football team names: \"America MG\", \"Botafogo RJ\", \"EC Bahia\", \"Fortaleza FC\", \"Vasco Da Gama RJ\", \"Goias\", \"Gremio\", \"Cuiaba\" — no accents, different conventions (\"America MG\" with space not dash; \"Botafogo RJ\"). My compact-key normalizer handles these: \"americamg\" → alias \"americamineiro\"; \"botafogorj\" → \"botafogo\"; \"ecbahia\" → alias \"bahia\"; \"fortalezafc\" → alias \"fortaleza\"; \"vascodagamarj\" → strip \"rj\" → \"vascodagama\" → alias \"vasco\"? I said alias \"vasco\"→\"vascodagama\"; simpler: make canonical \"vascodagama\" and alias \"vasco\"→\"vascodagama\". \"goias\" fine. \"cuiaba\" fine. \"atleticomg\"... this is \"Atletico Mineiro\" full name ✓.\n\nAlso \"Palmeiras 2023 Serie A: 37\" — hmm, 37 not 38. One match missing/postponed in dataset, or one 'NA'? 377 total for 2023 (vs 380) — 3 matches missing. Fine.\n\nLet me redo the verification handling NA.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_fc2a75b3d0011HteNvp6V9290U","sessionID":"ses_03d6082b8ffevm2f5lmWdFLskw","messageID":"msg_fc2a71ac2001931oWx8kKmdvgV"}}
